[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: MIL-STD-498 SPS (Software Product Specification)

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SPS-001
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Project Scope
STATEMENT: The project shall develop a comprehensive satellite communication management system with automated network control capabilities.
RATIONALE: This requirement ensures proper system functionality and compliance with standards.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SPS-002
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Project Objectives
STATEMENT: The project shall deliver a secure, scalable, and reliable system that meets military communication standards.
RATIONALE: This requirement ensures proper system functionality and compliance with standards.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SPS-003
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Project Timeline
STATEMENT: The project shall be completed within 18 months with defined milestones and deliverables.
RATIONALE: This requirement ensures proper system functionality and compliance with standards.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SPS-004
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Resource Requirements
STATEMENT: The project shall require a team of 15 developers, 5 testers, and 3 system administrators.
RATIONALE: This requirement ensures proper system functionality and compliance with standards.